  [[[[[[[libil2cpp.so+4913E20]+19C30]+230]+80]+C0]+20]+18]+178
Value A only updates when damage is settled by the server logic."</Comments>
    </CheatEntry>

    <CheatEntry>
      <ID>112</ID>
      <Description>"Self HP - value B (live / immediate)"</Description>
      <VariableType>Float</VariableType>
      <Address>"libil2cpp.so"+4913E20</Address>
      <Offsets>
        <Offset>4838</Offset>
        <Offset>18</Offset>
        <Offset>20</Offset>
        <Offset>C0</Offset>
        <Offset>80</Offset>
        <Offset>230</Offset>
        <Offset>19C30</Offset>
      </Offsets>
      <Comments>"Chain:
  [[[[[[[libil2cpp.so+4913E20]+19C30]+230]+80]+C0]+20]+18]+4838

0x4838 = 0x178 + 0x56C0 (sample pair distance, account specific).
Value B changes the instant damage happens and matches the drawn bar."</Comments>
    </CheatEntry>

