        <Offset>1D0</Offset>
        <Offset>140</Offset>
        <Offset>B8</Offset>
        <Offset>4FB0</Offset>
      </Offsets>
      <Comments>"Chain:
  [[[[[[[[[[libil2cpp.so+5601570]+4FB0]+B8]+140]+1D0]+70]+8]+28]+0]+28]+178

