    <CheatEntry>
      <ID>121</ID>
      <Description>"Attribute record array - stride 0x240"</Description>
      <VariableType>Float</VariableType>
      <Address>"libil2cpp.so"+4913E20</Address>
      <Offsets>
        <Offset>178</Offset>
        <Offset>18</Offset>
        <Offset>20</Offset>
        <Offset>C0</Offset>
        <Offset>80</Offset>
        <Offset>230</Offset>
        <Offset>19C30</Offset>
      </Offsets>
      <Comments>"The HP value is also the +0x178 field of a record inside an
array with stride 0x240. Example record bases seen at runtime:

  72E53BB25240, 72E53BB25480, 72E53BB256C0, 72E53BB25900 ...

Each record is a snapshot, not a live object: over 14 seconds only one
field (+0x078) changed by a tiny amount, everything else stayed static.
The record also holds about 19 pointers; expanding them two levels deep
gave 60 objects and only 3 of them changed over 20 seconds (one is a
copy of the global time). The skill cooldown is NOT in this tree."</Comments>
    </CheatEntry>

